canonical:
  title: The Canterbury Tales, The Second Nun’s Tale, 320–322
  author: Geoffrey Chaucer
  language: enm
  source: "https://www.gutenberg.org/ebooks/22120"
  text: |
    ‘Men mighten dreden wel and skilfully
    This lyf to lese, myn owene dere brother,
    If this were livinge only and non other.
